# anj-cloud (spec #21 step 6; decision #89 (2)): start the production VM at boot (libvirt autostart
# is off for anj-prod), with the backup share when DOS_BACKUP is mounted, else without it and one
# "running without backups" alert.
[Unit]
Description=anj-cloud production VM
Wants=libvirtd.service anj-cloud-forward.service mnt-anj\x2dbackup.mount
# After libvirt-guests too: its ON_BOOT start of a previously running anj-prod must not race
# vm-start's choice of definition (with or without the backup share).
After=libvirtd.service libvirt-guests.service anj-cloud-forward.service mnt-anj\x2dbackup.mount network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
RemainAfterExit=yes
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 -I /usr/local/lib/anj-cloud-host/vm-start
TimeoutStartSec=5min
MemoryMax=256M
TasksMax=64

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
